    35	            // The compensating surface the Patron's "Read-only now, Reply as
    36	            // follow-on" decree rests on: a link to the thread, not a write.
    37	            // Inbox has no per-petitio deep link (not owned by this opus —
    38	            // W-073 is where "Reply" itself lands), so this names the
    39	            // screen the thread lives on; the Patron finds it there.
    40	            <a className="board-drawer__banner-text board-drawer__banner-link" href="#/inbox">
    41	              {detail.waitingOn.petitio.subject} &mdash; from {detail.waitingOn.petitio.from}
