    95	/**
    96	 * Resolves a caller-supplied id (`--opus`, `--petitio`) to `<dir>/<id>.md`
    97	 * and refuses anything that would land outside `dir`. An id containing a
    98	 * path separator or a bare `.`/`..` segment is rejected outright, which is
    99	 * enough on its own to keep `join(dir, id + ".md")` inside `dir` — the
